+   |  ASCII      | next: ASCII/lead  |  not valid          |  next: cont.     |
+   |  (0-127)    | context: 4 - 63   |                     |  context: 2 - 3  |
+   |-------------|-------------------|---------------------|------------------|
+   |  cont. byte | next: ASCII/lead  |  next: ASCII/lead   |  next: cont.     |
+   |  (128-191)  | context: 4 - 63   |  context: 0 - 1     |  context: 2 - 3  |
