+   |  (192-207)  |                   |  context: 0 - 1     |                  |
+   |-------------|-------------------|---------------------|------------------|
+   |  lead byte  | not valid         |  next: cont.        |  not valid       |
+   |  (208-)     |                   |  context: 2 - 3     |                  |
+   |-------------|-------------------|---------------------|------------------|
+
+   The context id for the signed context mode is calculated as:
+
+     context = (kContextLookup[512 + p1] << 3) | kContextLookup[512 + p2].
